{
 "id": "puc1-electronics-10-logic-gates-and-boolean-algebra.t2.lesson",
 "chapterId": "puc1-electronics-10-logic-gates-and-boolean-algebra",
 "topicId": "puc1-electronics-10-logic-gates-and-boolean-algebra.t2",
 "title": {
  "en": "Universal gates (NAND, NOR) and XOR, XNOR",
  "kn": "ಸಾರ್ವತ್ರಿಕ ದ್ವಾರಗಳು (ನ್ಯಾಂಡ್, ನಾರ್) ಮತ್ತು ಎಕ್ಸ್‌ಆರ್, ಎಕ್ಸ್‌ನಾರ್"
 },
 "minutes": 40,
 "blocks": [
  {
   "id": "intro",
   "type": "intro",
   "heading": {
    "en": "Gates with a twist",
    "kn": "ವಿಶೇಷ ದ್ವಾರಗಳು"
   },
   "hook": {
    "en": "Inside every computer chip, almost everything is built from just one kind of gate, the NAND gate. Today we see why.",
    "kn": "ಪ್ರತಿ ಕಂಪ್ಯೂಟರ್ ಚಿಪ್‌ನೊಳಗೆ ಬಹುತೇಕ ಎಲ್ಲವೂ ನ್ಯಾಂಡ್ ಎಂಬ ಒಂದೇ ಬಗೆಯ ದ್ವಾರದಿಂದ ನಿರ್ಮಿತ. ಇಂದು ಅದಕ್ಕೆ ಕಾರಣ ನೋಡೋಣ."
   },
   "objectives": [
    {
     "en": "State the expressions and truth tables of NAND, NOR, XOR and XNOR"
    },
    {
     "en": "Explain why NAND and NOR are universal"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Inside every computer chip, almost everything is built from just one kind of gate, the NAND gate. Today we see why.",
    "kn": "ಪ್ರತಿ ಕಂಪ್ಯೂಟರ್ ಚಿಪ್‌ನೊಳಗೆ ಬಹುತೇಕ ಎಲ್ಲವೂ ನ್ಯಾಂಡ್ ಎಂಬ ಒಂದೇ ಬಗೆಯ ದ್ವಾರದಿಂದ ನಿರ್ಮಿತ. ಇಂದು ಅದಕ್ಕೆ ಕಾರಣ ನೋಡೋಣ."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "NAND and NOR"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "NAND is AND followed by NOT: $Y = \\overline{A\\cdot B}$; its output is 0 only when all inputs are 1. NOR is OR followed by NOT: $Y = \\overline{A+B}$; its output is 1 only when all inputs are 0. They are called universal gates because any Boolean function can be built using only NAND gates or only NOR gates."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "NAND: Y = (A·B)', 0 only for all 1s"
    },
    {
     "en": "NOR: Y = (A + B)', 1 only for all 0s"
    },
    {
     "en": "Both are universal gates"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "NAND is AND with an inverted output, NOR is OR with an inverted output. Either one alone can build every other gate.",
    "kn": "ನ್ಯಾಂಡ್ ಎಂದರೆ ತಲೆಕೆಳಗಾದ ಔಟ್‌ಪುಟ್ ಇರುವ ಆಂಡ್, ನಾರ್ ಎಂದರೆ ತಲೆಕೆಳಗಾದ ಔಟ್‌ಪುಟ್ ಇರುವ ಆರ್. ಇವುಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಯಾವುದಾದರೂ ಒಂದರಿಂದ ಎಲ್ಲಾ ದ್ವಾರಗಳನ್ನು ನಿರ್ಮಿಸಬಹುದು."
   }
  },
